SDUSD::recoverUnaccountedAssets
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is the owner
    ├── when DUSD balance equals accountedAssets
    │   ├── it should return zero
    │   ├── it should not transfer DUSD
    │   └── it should not emit UnaccountedAssetsRecovered
    ├── when unaccounted DUSD exists
    │   ├── it should calculate recoveredAssets as DUSD balance minus accountedAssets
    │   ├── it should transfer exactly recoveredAssets to the configured rewarder
    │   ├── it should emit UnaccountedAssetsRecovered
    │   ├── it should leave the vault DUSD balance equal to accountedAssets
    │   ├── it should not change accountedAssets
    │   └── it should not change totalAssets
    ├── when a reward release is active and unaccounted DUSD exists
    │   ├── it should use accountedAssets rather than totalAssets to calculate recoveredAssets
    │   ├── it should recover only the unaccounted DUSD
    │   ├── it should leave all locked rewards in the vault
    │   └── it should leave all reward accounting unchanged
    ├── when the configured rewarder has changed
    │   └── it should transfer recovered DUSD to the current configured rewarder
    └── when PAUSE_TYPE is paused
        └── it should allow recovery
